# profile: anthropic
# @tier: 1
# @summary: Claude for chat; embeddings from OpenAI because Anthropic has no embeddings API.
# @key: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY in .env, plus EMBEDDING_API_KEY (an OpenAI key) for embeddings. Without the second,
#   semantic search falls back to full-text.
# @cost: pay per token on both accounts
# @dotnet: yes
# @verified: STUB-TESTED ONLY (tests/test_anthropic_provider.py on Python, a stub handler on .NET). Never run
#   against the live API: tool-choice quality, streaming edge cases and real error shapes are unknown.
# @evals: live quality and safety suites through the eval CLI, capability check, cost; replay gate not applicable
# @judge: not the model under test. Suggestion only, not calibrated (D-7, M3).
# @judge-env: JUDGE_PROVIDER=openai JUDGE_MODEL=gpt-5.1
LLM_PROVIDER=anthropic
LLM_BASE_URL=
ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5-5
EMBEDDING_PROVIDER=openai
EMBEDDING_BASE_URL=
EMBEDDING_MODEL=text-embedding-3-small
EMBEDDING_DIM=1536
